2. Body edit wins over docstring for ℹ️ anchor (`_run_is_docstring_only`)
3. Drop IDE risk rail on `def` — implication stays in HUD/JSON/PR only
4. With `focus.llmCaptions`: wait for open-file LLM before first paint (no short deterministic flash); rest background
